Hello everyone,

The Open is this Saturday. Check-in opens at 09:00 and closes at 09:40
sharp, and the first round starts at 10:00. Anyone arriving after
check-in closes will receive a bye for round one and join from round
two.

Please bring your own copy of the game and make sure the weather deck
has all 24 cards. We have a few spare decks at the judges' table if
yours is incomplete.

A quick reminder about timing: each round is 75 minutes, and when time
is called you play out the current round of turns so everyone has had
the same number, then score as normal.

If players end level on match points, we separate them by total game
points, then by sigils claimed, then by the strength of the opponents
they met.

Lunch is after round three. See you on Saturday.

Cheers,
Tomas
Head judge, Cairnfall Open
